# `.claude/skills/*` are machine-local symlinks (absolute paths) into
# `.agents/skills/`, created by the `skills` CLI (npx skills add ...). The
# real, portable skill content lives in .agents/skills/ and is tracked;
# skills-lock.json records the source so `npx skills add` can regenerate
# these symlinks on any machine.
.claude/skills/
